@base <http://example.com/> .
@prefix cprmv: <https://standaarden.open-regels.nl/standards/cprmv/0.4.3#> .
@prefix cprmv-serve: <https://cprmv.open-regels.nl/0.4.3/serve-api/> .
@prefix cprmvmethods: <https://cprmv.open-regels.nl/0.4.3/methods/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

cprmvmethods:regelspraak a cprmv:FormalisationMethod;
    cprmv:id "RegelSpraak"@en;
    cprmv:id "RegelSpraak"@fr;
    cprmv:id "RegelSpraak"@nl;
    cprmv:label "RegelSpraak";
    skos:prefLabel "RegelSpraak";
    skos:definition """# ALEF RegelSpraak

The alef-regelspraak method is a formalisation method that can be used within the ALEF IDE by the Dutch national tax authority.
It is to some extend analogous to RuleSpeak and defines a controlled Dutch natural language.""";
    cprmv:comment "see https://regelspraak.nl".
